This setting of the 105CA is centered on 28.500 MHz
for Phone operation.  It features an extremely high
Front-to-Back ratio. 2:1 VSWR band-width is 600 KHz,
maximum gain is 7.56 dBd, and maximum F/B is 36 dB.

Beta rod length= 10.375 inches (measured from inside
tubing edge to outside edge of clamp).  Pigtail
length= 7 inches.  Balun= Hy-Gain BN-4000 (current
type).

Radiation patterns and VSWR were verified in September
1991.  9-18-91  RC



